    "text": "I, Kanapathipillai Cathiravelpillai Logeswaran the Governor of the Western Province, in accordance with the powers vestedin me by Paragraph (8)(a) in clause 154B of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka do herebysummon the Western Province Provincial Council to meet on 29th December 2016 at 9.30 a. m. in order to consider theBill of Development (Special Provision) issued on 25th November 2016 in the Council Chamber of the Provincial CouncilBuilding Complex situated at No. 204, Denzil Kobbekaduwa Mawatha, Battaramulla.",
